                                                "sense_id": "3b3499bf-5596-3435-a5bc-1c207d1dd897",
                                                "text": "When I returned to the movie Ghilli, a Kollywood classic (Kollywood being the informal name for Tamil cinema) that I loved as a kid, I couldn’t help but question why the story continues romantically, without question, after the heroine is slapped by the supposed love of her life."
                                            }
